  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "5G發展與智慧生活",
    "sub_ename": "5G DEVELOPMENT AND SMART LIFE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將以深入淺出的方式介紹5G、物聯網 、人工智慧 、大數據、雲端等科技知識，並討論5G帶給我們在經濟、文化、生活型態上的改變與影響，讓我們面對5G浪潮，有深刻的人文思維。5G相關技術將以科普的方式介紹，只要是對新事物、新技術有興趣的同學都可以很容易的弄懂。人文議題將以討論的方式進行，激發同學的人文關懷與獨立思考，具備宏觀思維、掌握科技潮流。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will introduce 5G, Internet of Things, artificial intelligence, big data, cloud and other scientific and technological knowledge in a simple way, and discuss the changes and influences that 5G has brought us in economy, culture and lifestyle, so that we can face the 5G wave and have profound humanistic thinking. 5G related technologies will be introduced in a popular science way, and students who are interested in new things and technologies can easily understand them. Humanistic issues will be discussed to stimulate students' humanistic care and independent thinking, to have macro thinking and to master the trend of science and technology.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "建立學生5G相關的科技知識。",
      "describe_en": "Establishing 5G related technological knowledge for students."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "啟發學生5G衝擊的人文關懷。",
      "describe_en": "Inspiring students’ humanistic care about the impact of 5G."
    }
  ],
